Maintainer: xiaprojects <xiaprojects@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Depends: @SHLIBS@
Recommends: wayfire, waydroid, chromium | chromium-browser, curl, rb-taskmanager-onlyserver
Description: Wayfire layout switcher for Waydroid and RB-01 screens
 GTK3 / gtk-layer-shell overlay button for Wayland + Wayfire that cycles the
 visible layout: app A, B or C full screen, or A|B side by side. Windows are
 found by Wayland app-id and/or title through Wayfire IPC; missing apps are
 started and placed as soon as their window appears. Also exposes
 /api/mode/N on localhost.
 .
 Start it from the Wayfire session ([autostart] in wayfire.ini):
   /opt/rb-taskmanager/bin/rb-layout-switcher
 Configure in /etc/rb-taskmanager/layout-switcher.conf.
